  "permissionRules": [
    "When a workflow/job permissions map is declared, omitted scopes are none; a job map overrides workflow defaults rather than unioning them.",
    "Missing both workflow/job permissions is unknown repository/organization default, not proof of read-only; no automatic opt-in.",
    "Reject write-all or any repository/API write scope, including contents/packages/actions/issues/pull-requests/deployments/checks/statuses etc.",
    "id-token:write allows OIDC JWT requests and does not itself grant repository/API writes. Preserve it for existing workloads.",
    "Reusable workflow token permissions can be maintained or reduced, never elevated. Actual ui-policy/image-checks and self-hosted-image/image both request packages:write.",
    "Sibling jobs do not share their GITHUB_TOKEN permission maps. ui-policy's five direct installers retain contents:read independently of image-checks."
  ],
  "preservation": [
    "Preserve all existing workflow/job permissions and publish/screenshot duties.",
    "Do not remove the image's REGISTRY_TOKEN publish step or screenshot evidence publisher.",
    "Keep b87 downloader/helper, manifest hashes, two-source/timeout/redirect/integrity/cleanup contracts unchanged.",
    "Shared action credential must be explicit optional input default empty, with no github.token fallback.",
    "The install step should use only the explicit input, overriding ambient FFMPEG_GITHUB_TOKEN to empty when absent."
  ],
  "focusedTestsRequired": [
    "Execute the actual composite install command with a tiny offline package's real postinstall: omitted input plus synthetic write-capable caller token must not expose FFMPEG_GITHUB_TOKEN.",
    "Execute the same real postinstall for an explicitly opted-in API-read-only caller; only the explicit synthetic value is visible.",
    "Default empty input must not silently fall back to github.token or an ambient FFMPEG_GITHUB_TOKEN.",
    "Static actual-callsite coverage rejects an opt-in for screenshots/image, write-all, any non-OIDC write key, and unknown permission defaults.",
    "Permission fixtures verify job contents:read overrides workflow write map; job write overrides workflow read map; id-token:write plus API read map is classified separately.",
    "Verify reusable image caller and callee permissions are considered and no automatic image env/--secret supply remains; preserve existing original permission and publishing steps."
